# =============================================================================
# Production GCP build + recipe configuration
# =============================================================================
#
# You may copy this file to ``.envs/.production/.google-cloud/.build`` before
# your first ``just gcp deploy-all prod``. The ``just gcp`` module sources it
# only in recipes that support optional deploy-time knobs.
#
# This file is not uploaded to Secret Manager and is not an application runtime
# env file. The current release defines no GCP ``.build`` variables, so the file
# intentionally contains no assignments and may be omitted. Add a value only
# when a current recipe explicitly documents it.
#
# Keep this file private; the whole .envs/ tree is gitignored.
# =============================================================================


# -- Runtime configuration belongs in .django ------------------------------
#
# The stage's ``.django`` file is the single authoring location for Django
# runtime settings. This includes embedded MCP OAuth, all x402 values, Stripe,
# audit archival, and their secrets. Do not duplicate any of them here.
